  "Caml League, is a two-player soccer game where players try to score as many goals as they can within a set time frame. Both players can play on the same device. Player 1 controls with WASD, while Player 2 uses the arrow keys. Our project is developed in OCaml using js_of_ocaml for the web page and the elm_playground library for graphics."
